<p>Enter a calm, focused stance, increasing physical power and accuracy by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Dexterity 100">19, 24, 29, 32, 35,</acronym> projectile speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">45%, 71%, 87%, 98%, 106%</acronym> and the chance to mark targets by an additional <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2%, 4%, 6%, 8%, 10%.</acronym></p><p>This makes your shots more effective at range, increasing all damage dealt by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.7%, 2.6%, 3.2%, 3.7%, 4.1%</acronym> per tile travelled beyond 3, to a maximum of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8.3%, 13%, 16%, 18%, 20%</acronym> damage at range 8.</p><p>The physical power and accuracy increase with your Dexterity. This requires a bow to use.</p>